WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.760
Anandpur, 1699.

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:07.520
A huge crowd has gathered for
Vaisakhi, the spring harvest festival.

3
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:11.380
Sikh accounts say Guru Gobind
Singh drew his sword and asked:

4
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.930
who will give his head for the Guru?

5
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.240
Silence.

6
00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.370
Then one man stood.

7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.270
So why would a Guru ask a huge crowd
which of them would give him their head?

8
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.530
In this mission, you'll
follow the story step by step,

9
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.770
and meet the five who came forward.

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:32.810
Then you'll see how Sikhs in Punjab and
in Britain celebrate Vaisakhi today.

11
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:37.670
Your mission: find out why a Guru asked
a huge crowd which of them would give

12
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.610
him their head.
